{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-relative-dimension}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a5f5f79ab636f17a6c1518587695054aecec587e4ecf86e5c5111a9aa112ba91", "source_text": "Morphisms of given relative dimension", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cfe81ec086a0da72fb75a065343484fcea603b4212c374d82f70fee1526b8b88", "unit_id": "tag:02NI:title"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7911083d4f3da6e7d1075a6796ff2dbd8f73861bb2f9120e2a1454c8a092496f", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn order to be able to speak comfortably about morphisms of a\ngiven relative dimension we introduce the following notion.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:001892643a1d83f393e5dd590cf5f9c7792c4f781ac64ca2ff4e87421f6be9d2", "unit_id": "tag:02NI:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$\\leq d$", "MATH_0005": "$x$", "MATH_0006": "$\\dim_x(X_{f(x)}) \\leq d$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$\\leq d$", "MATH_0009": "$\\dim_x(X_{f(x)}) \\leq d$", "MATH_0010": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0011": "$f$", "MATH_0012": "$d$", "MATH_0013": "$X_s$", "MATH_0014": "$d$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-relative-dimension-d}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e53bac324a6915b838c108ffea0460306a70b1cab28545a49e0e718ea41f1ca0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f99103812ddc44c0962f2fac7cdf2432cf4eb8bb2b0ddd9b9b7249738ce689fa", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nAssume <MATH_0002> is locally of finite type.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0003> is of <TEXTITOPEN_0001>relative dimension <MATH_0004> at <MATH_0005><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if\n<MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say <MATH_0007> is of <TEXTITOPEN_0002>relative dimension <MATH_0008><TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if\n<MATH_0009> for all <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004> We say <MATH_0011> is of <TEXTITOPEN_0003>relative dimension <MATH_0012><TEXTITCLOSE_0003> if\nall nonempty fibres <MATH_0013> are equidimensional of dimension <MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9f71ff98c9927a1c0a65234b12ea5376ac3ba7ec4a38547cfbe876b29096aaaa", "unit_id": "tag:02NJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7911083d4f3da6e7d1075a6796ff2dbd8f73861bb2f9120e2a1454c8a092496f", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis is not a particularly well behaved notion, but it works well\nin a number of situations.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8b3d5a5d5248f657ce0b01e8105d698ff397fe4d2aa984f67ce9fcac0c0df639", "unit_id": "tag:02NI:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$d$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\leq d$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-relative-dimension-d}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c96316f0e394f5decc91985b5a3e9582a30bc7915da5e7b11359590d2bef3a1c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a7cc9d14436c5e6ea4d0e456a6294c61bee1decbceacd4395aee3dac47161ff9", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes which is locally of finite type.\nIf <MATH_0002> has relative dimension <MATH_0003>, then so does any base change of <MATH_0004>.\nSame for relative dimension <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8b5cddd0b75e5a1c096d5cd595b416e3182abde06f37d2cae08cd0182950dd64", "unit_id": "tag:02NK:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-dimension-fibre-after-base-change}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a954b28474be78607e1f7c5734478f1d8ad885368ac352cfa8e640417375337b", "source_text": "This is immediate from\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2e577719e93b3d8ed233123f578cd5c1eec37fc749876b2661b82460a905e400", "unit_id": "tag:02NK:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$g : Y \\to Z$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$\\leq d$", "MATH_0005": "$g$", "MATH_0006": "$\\leq e$", "MATH_0007": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0008": "$\\leq d + e$", "MATH_0009": "$f$", "MATH_0010": "$d$", "MATH_0011": "$g$", "MATH_0012": "$e$", "MATH_0013": "$f$", "MATH_0014": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0015": "$d + e$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-relative-dimension-d}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d0d9317a1019aeb7ae94e9157738e0b4d4d3b682fac5be07f9ccfa97141500d2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3353171bd0f041b9d1dfb8ddb0336d26d3324342542f762945235756cb854445", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be locally of finite type.\nIf <MATH_0003> has relative dimension <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> has relative dimension <MATH_0006>\nthen <MATH_0007> has relative dimension <MATH_0008>.\nIf\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0009> has relative dimension <MATH_0010>,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0011> has relative dimension <MATH_0012>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0013> is flat,\n<STRUCT_0005>\nthen <MATH_0014> has relative dimension <MATH_0015>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9869a09638c5c3cab1c7106e73b60df48a411cc169af5146a5e7a43672c0eb70", "unit_id": "tag:02NL:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02NI", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-dimension-fibre-at-a-point-additive}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8b05bf2dd2ec3609082a91936a441ea22b26b99464b92ecb3912ae6b3747ed5a", "source_text": "This is immediate from Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5331ae10dfd36c60c863601b69d1b5c964a4aa2703a237f062d17518d14c3583", "unit_id": "tag:02NL:proof"}
